# Converted per-instance models: only the canonical artifact files are
# tracked (model + chor-js render report per instance) — the regression
# baseline, auditable via git diff. Everything else under data/output
# (rendered SVGs — large, regenerable — and ad-hoc files) stays ignored.
# The negations below deliberately override the global *.bpmn above.
data/output/**
!data/output/*/
!data/output/.gitkeep
!data/output/*/*.bpmn
!data/output/*/*.chorjs.report.json
